# Keep the build context small and reproducible — pull in only source, let the
# image build the frontend bundle and backend jar from scratch.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.gradle
.git
.gitignore
**/.impeccable
**/*.log
# Never let a machine-local secrets file into an image built locally (the server
# builds from git where it doesn't exist, but a local `docker build` would copy it).
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.yaml
PLAN.md
docs
docker-compose.yml
